## Actions an agent can take

- Query logs: `cx logs "filter $m.severity == ERROR"`
- Query traces: `cx traces "filter $d.http.status_code >= 500"`
- List dashboards: `cx dashboards list`
- Manage alerts: `cx incidents`, `cx notifications`
- Manage SLOs: `cx slos`
- Drive TCO policies: `cx tco`
- Manage integrations: `cx integrations`
- Manage IAM and pipelines: `cx iam`, `cx pipelines`

